+# T68 Result
+
+## Files created/modified
+
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/metrics/mod.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/metrics/report.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/metrics/report_benchmark.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/metrics/report_tests.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/Cargo.toml`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/bin/lattice_report.rs`
+- `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-metrics-report.md`
+
+## Verification commands and outputs
+
+- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/bin/lattice_report.rs`
+  - `ok`
+- `test -f docs/architecture/2026-05-16-metrics-report.md`
+  - `ok`
+- `cd daemon && cargo build --release --bin lattice_report`
+  - `Finished 'release' profile [optimized] target(s) in 2m 11s`
+  - Existing workspace warnings from `lattice-daemon` lib remain:
+    - `current_parsed_files_snapshot` is never used
+    - `select_diff_impact_mode` is never used
+    - `diff_impact_widen_reason` is never used
+    - `seed_from_context_capsule` is never used
+    - `seed_from_diff_impact` is never used
+    - `attach_context_capsule_suggested_expand` is never used
+    - `context_capsule_suggested_expand` is never used
+    - `resolve_capsule_symbol_handle` is never used
+    - `RankedMemory` is never constructed
+    - `token_budget_limit` is never used
+- `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib metrics::report_tests`
+  - `6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 517 filtered out`
+  - Covered:
+    - deterministic rendering across text/json/ci-summary
+    - baseline delta computation
+    - threshold pass/fail logic
+    - honest null rendering
+    - fail-on-regression exit-code logic
+    - benchmark evidence-pointer round-trip
+
+## Issues encountered
+
+- The first implementation of `report.rs` exceeded the repo file-length ceiling at 1145 lines.
+  - Fixed by splitting benchmark reconstruction and evidence loading into `report_benchmark.rs`.
+- `MetricSignal` does not implement `Ord`.
+  - Fixed by replacing internal `BTreeMap` usage with `HashMap` in the report implementation.
+- The new CLI binary initially missed the `MetricSource` import.
+  - Fixed in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/bin/lattice_report.rs`.
+- The benchmark evidence helper initially returned references to a local `String`.
+  - Fixed by switching memory-label specs to owned `String` values.
+- Cargo artifact locking briefly blocked repeated build/test invocations during iterative verification.
+  - Resolved by waiting for the active cargo invocation to finish before rerunning the exact harness commands.
+
+## Final status
+
+complete

